WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:01.480
Now in the army

00:02.360 --> 00:03.840
Most are our trusted men

00:03.920 --> 00:05.840
Chen Ying wants to kill me

00:05.920 --> 00:07.320
It's not that easy

00:07.440 --> 00:08.520
Now Prince Ning has controlled

00:08.600 --> 00:10.000
The court situation

00:10.600 --> 00:12.000
Has all the advantages

00:12.480 --> 00:14.147
If I raise troops now

00:14.640 --> 00:16.040
It's disloyalty

00:16.320 --> 00:18.080
Using the northern expedition to march south

00:18.160 --> 00:19.520
It's unjust

00:19.600 --> 00:20.960
Brothers fighting

00:22.160 --> 00:23.560
Is even unfilial

00:23.800 --> 00:25.467
An army without just cause

00:26.080 --> 00:27.480
How can it win?

00:27.560 --> 00:28.240
Your Highness

00:28.400 --> 00:29.840
Your Highness, Your Highness

00:31.680 --> 00:33.280
My mind is made up

00:33.360 --> 00:35.693
This matter, speak no more of it

00:40.440 --> 00:42.080
Since Lord Xie has come

00:42.160 --> 00:43.920
Stay with me in the army

00:44.000 --> 00:45.400
Zhu Yuanzhi

00:46.080 --> 00:47.747
Tomorrow you come with me

00:47.920 --> 00:49.560
To apologize with bared back

00:51.000 --> 01:05.000
Half a year later, a catastrophic fire suddenly broke out in the Prince of Jin's estate. More than forty souls residing within all tragically perished.

01:08.000 --> 01:17.500
Panic gripped court officials. Seizing this opportunity, Prince Ning carried out a sweeping purge, eradicating all dissent from Great Xuan's imperial court.

